data: {"answer": "這裡是「港口廣場・供應商」，主要展示度假村如何與老城店家及供應商連線。\n可在此觀察到的防護措施包括廠商風險管理與匯款變更回撥確認。\n相關威脅為第三方與供應鏈入侵、商務郵件詐騙。\n你可以前往防波堤・網路邊界、隱私小教堂（導覽稱湖畔教堂）、市集廣場・網路銷售或麵包店・供應商入口網站繼續探索。", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "供應商入口網站是做什麼的？", "en": "What does the Supplier Portal do?", "zh": "供應商入口網站是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "第三方與供應鏈入侵要怎麼防？", "en": "How do we prevent Third-Party & Supply-Chain compromise?", "zh": "第三方與供應鏈入侵要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 9.55, "total_s": 9.57}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "town_square", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "town_square"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 5.7}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "town_square", "label": "Room", "en": "Harbour Square", "zh": "港口廣場"}, {"key": "supplier_portal", "label": "System", "en": "Supplier Portal", "zh": "供應商入口網站"}, {"key": "supply_chain", "label": "Threat", "en": "Third-Party & Supply-Chain Compromise", "zh": "第三方與供應鏈入侵"}, {"key": "bec", "label": "Threat", "en": "Business Email Compromise", "zh": "商務郵件詐騙"}, {"key": "vendor_management", "label": "Control", "en": "Vendor Risk Management", "zh": "廠商風險管理"}, {"key": "payment_callback", "label": "Control", "en": "Payment Change Call-Back", "zh": "匯款變更回撥確認"}, {"key": "c_supply_chain_risk", "label": "Concept", "en": "Supply-Chain Risk", "zh": "供應鏈風險"}], "edges": [{"a": "vendor_management", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "town_square"}, {"a": "vendor_management", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "supplier_portal"}, {"a": "vendor_management", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "bec"}, {"a": "vendor_management", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "supply_chain"}, {"a": "supplier_portal", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "town_square"}, {"a": "bec", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "town_square"}, {"a": "supply_chain", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "supplier_portal"}, {"a": "supply_chain", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "town_square"}, {"a": "c_supply_chain_risk", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "town_square"}, {"a": "c_supply_chain_risk", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "supply_chain"}, {"a": "c_supply_chain_risk", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "vendor_management"}, {"a": "payment_callback", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "town_square"}, {"a": "payment_callback", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "bec"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：港口廣場・供應商\n代表的資訊主題：老城的店家都是渡假村的供應商，各自用不同方式跟渡假村連線。\n重點：你的資安強度，取決於最弱的那個供應商。\n這裡的系統：供應商入口網站\n這裡要注意的威脅：第三方與供應鏈入侵、商務郵件詐騙\n看得到的防護措施：廠商風險管理、匯款變更回撥確認\n課程概念：供應鏈風險\n相關的處理流程：供應商要求變更匯款帳戶、廠商要遠端連線\n可以走到：防波堤・網路邊界、隱私小教堂（導覽裡的名稱：湖畔教堂）、市集廣場・網路銷售、麵包店・供應商入口網站", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 9.55, "load_s": 0.0, "prompt_tokens": 594, "prompt_s": 2.6, "gen_tokens": 88, "gen_s": 6.93, "tok_per_s": 12.7, "first_token_s": 2.62}}, "state": {}}

